    "group": "Stormfang Gunship",
    "summary": "After this model shoots in your Shooting phase, if its helfrost destructor hit an enemy **MONSTER** or **VEHICLE** unit at least once, that unit is Frozen until your opponent's following turn ends. While Frozen, a unit:\n\n- has its Move characteristic reduced by 2\n- has 2 taken off its **Advance** and **Charge rolls**",
